    "R1": {
      "title": "Resolution 1",
      "text": "Dr. Marquez nods along to Bertie’s observation. “You’re onto something. The bliss is almost a kind of lure. Draw in prey, numb them to pain and drain them of their faculties, then devour what remains.” The professor arches an eyebrow. “It would have to be a highly advanced apex predator. Although I’m still suspicious the odd behavior is due to toxic gas.”",
